    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/construction-engineer/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Construction Engineer theme is a professional, feature-rich WordPress solution designed for construction companies, civil engineers, architects, builders, contractors, and infrastructure developers. Ideal for building contractors, real estate developers, renovation experts, architectural studios, and industrial engineering firms, it supports niches like civil construction, design and build, construction equipment suppliers, urban planning, and project management. With a clean, modern, and fully responsive layout, the theme ensures your construction portfolio, engineering services, and architectural projects look stunning across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. SEO-optimized and fast-loading, it helps your site rank for terms like construction company website, civil engineering firm, architecture studio, contractor portfolio, and building design. Customization options allow effortless adjustment of colors, typography, and layouts to match your brand identity. The theme integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce for selling services or products, Contact Form 7 and WPForms for client inquiries and quotes, Yoast SEO for search optimization, The Events Calendar for project timelines, and Slider Revolution for showcasing projects. With dedicated sections for project portfolios, service listings, team profiles, and testimonials, Construction Engineer empowers businesses to build credibility, attract clients, and grow their presence in the competitive construction and engineering industry."
    },
